WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:04.500
What's up guys!

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.520
We are for Pongfinity

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.340
It's time for another episode of
Challenge Pongfinity

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.540
Let's try to hit the mousetrap

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:15.800
With a ping pong ball

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:29.020
Okay the first player to set off both mousetraps wins

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.820
So we have launched our own
mobile game

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.140
and as we mentioned

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:50.380
There is a little surprise at score 100

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.360
So the challenge is to get there

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:53.420
Let's do it!

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:58.440
The idea of the game is to get as many
shots in as possible

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.340
You can hit harder with a longer swipe

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.320
It's good to use one hand to move

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.800
And the other hand to hit

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:19.340
It helps you if you double-click into the shot

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:20.540
And hit harder

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:23.000
So the ball comes slower back to you

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:26.240
A robot

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:30.020
The robot is quite hard

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:33.100
We really like the game

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:35.000
so make sure to download it for free

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.320
On Apple and Android

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.100
And try to beat our high scores!

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:41.460
Okay we are ready for some double decker ping pong

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:42.540
Let's try it out!

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:02.760
Two balls at the same time

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:33.000
I can't reach there!

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:48.680
Let's try playing with an umbrella!

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.340
I don't know what part to hit with

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:53.680
Maybe the top part

00:02:58.800 --> 00:02:59.940
Yeah, this part is good

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:12.440
Too late!

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:26.880
Umbrella number two!

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.020
Only with the push of the button

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.340
I was expecting it to do like...

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:52.320
Starting to break?

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:52.860
Maybe

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:57.880
Maybe? Maybe.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.700
No around the net for Otto this time

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:07.460
It was fun as long as it lasted...

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:09.820
I still think you can use these

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:12.500
They didn't really survive the playing

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.660
But don't forget to hit subscribe

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:17.280
And watch our previous videos there

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.620
until next time

